{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body><p>更新時間：14:13 2026-08-27 HKT<br/>發佈時間：14:13 2026-08-27 HKT</p>\n<p>發佈時間：14:13 2026-08-27 HKT</p><p>今日（27日）下午12時56分，土瓜灣新碼頭街38號翔龍灣一名12歲少年，在屋苑會所打保齡球期間，J右手前臂被夾在保齡球回球機器內，無法掙脫。消防員到場為少年解困，他右手前臂紅腫，由救護車送伊利沙伯醫院治理，意外原因有待調查。</p><img alt=\"少年手部輕傷由救護車送院。劉漢權攝\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/4f21006a2822c8386a203df669dd461c/2026-08/4_0_14.jpeg\"/><img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/a92f64e667e0867db907cb891ad71485/2026-08/3_0_11.jpeg\"/><img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/ea37ac126cb4a3326097c589913a303d/2026-08/2_0_20.jpeg\"/><img alt=\"少年手部輕傷由救護車送院。劉漢權攝\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/9b850f98ab3a7ecf3e74a14bee5ee268/2026-08/1_2_26.jpeg\"/><img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/80ecf7ba2be5af777384ab536c6712e9/2026-08/WhatsApp_Image_2026-08-27_at_13_29_04_2_.jpeg\"/><img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/305a830e50fc67ff8df05af4a24c1d9a/2026-08/WhatsApp_Image_2026-08-27_at_13_29_03.jpeg\"/><img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/168044d6d4acd3acb1bd789dba8a2cf2/2026-08/WhatsApp_Image_2026-08-27_at_13_29_02_1_.jpeg\"/><p>最Hit</p>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-08-27T08:00:23.920881+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":196,"images":7,"source":"星島頭條","fallback":"none"}}